# Scrabble tile 1: a giant ivory Scrabble tile (game_ivory) 1.1 m square and 0.25 m thick, lying blank side up on the board with
# no letter or score, its edges well worn and soft (7 cm rounding). Ground clutter: no collider, scattered by the dozen between the pieces.
format 1

# An eighth of the vertices its size would give it: a plain rounded slab
Detail detail=0.12
    Translate translation=(0, 0.125, 0)
        Material material=game_ivory
            RoundBox size=(0.55, 0.125, 0.55) roundness=0.07
